class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Notice that the expression we need to subtract from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"68\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> must be expanded using the distributive law. </p>\n<p>So first, let's write some big brackets around the expression in parentheses, keeping the minus sign <em>outside</em>.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"69\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">[</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">]</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Next, we expand the expression inside the brackets using the distributive law. This gives</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"70\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">[</mo></mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we remove the brackets by distributing the negative sign. This gives</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"71\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we collect like terms:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabin